                                </p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low border border-surface-container-high/30 space-y-1">
                                <h4 class="font-bold text-xs text-on-surface">Can I withdraw earned LinkDrops?</h4>
